Additional notice (not part of the MIT license text):

This project talks directly to the Embedded Controller of specific Clevo
barebones and bundles the third-party WinRing0x64 driver binary for EC
access. Fan/lighting control carries inherent risk; use at your own risk
and check your machine's warranty terms before distributing builds that
include the driver payload.
